\f1\fs22 Our learned colleagues, historians, chroniclers, and people who apparently have editorials published in the Journal of Retrospective Busy-Bodying purely for the footnote privileges\'97have squabbled for centuries over just when the Elvi began referring to Sarah as the Holy Momma. Some woo-woo credentialists claim the clones \'93always knew\'94, much as refrigerators \'93always smell\'94, small children \'93always bounce\'94, or \'93the grass is always greener than coke or amphetamines\'94. Others argue, at Sarah\'92s first and last Vegas show, the Elvi had already given her the quasi-religious title; still others push for a late-dating hypothesis, setting her beatification as late as the forming of the inaugural Elvi Parliament and the election of the supremely coiffed High Elvis.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable><!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 To be honest, we\'92re hedging. And to our collegiate critics that angle for an earlier dating of the Elvi proclaiming Sarah as the Holy Momma, we concede that yes, learning the peculiar origins of Sarah\'92s immaculate conception may have jolted a certain religious awe in the Elvi as of the day Kathy ran the DNA tests, but we believe there are other more prosaic explanations.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The very day the results landed, the day Sarah learned about the genetic soup that rendered her uterus a battleground, was 25th April. An auspicious date, as it\'92s the only government-sanctioned public holiday for Ulyssian Cloudborne, who otherwise never get a break\'97not for Christmas, Easter, Eureka Stockade Day, Melbourne Cup Day, nor even for the birthday of Kylie Minogue.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Officially, 25th April commemorates the day the imperium of Royal Britannia (God rest all her stuffed animals and marital disputes) landed a rag-tag force known as the Ulyssia and New Sheepland Army Corps\'97or, UNSACs\'97as cannon fodder onto the wrong beach during the second year of World War Seven. \
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>But there\'92s another indelible 25th April event: the birth of one Gladys Love in Pontotoc County, Mississippi, a mere fifteen miles outside Tupelo, and three years before UNSAC Day. Yes, Elvis\'92s mum. The original Holy Momma.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>This fact muddies the honorific river considerably. Evidence abounds that Elvi clones\'97fresh from their first unboxing by Grayling Corp, still drowsy from factory air and packing peanuts\'97were minted to hold their original\'92s mother in high, possibly hysterical, esteem. When, exactly, Gladys became the Holy Momma, and when her title migrated to Sarah, is likely to fuel scholarly fisticuffs for the next several centuries. Even the most recent International Conference on Elvi Canonical Titling dissolved into chaos, resulting in the first documented use of a rhinestone gavel in an impromptu proctological exam.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>In conclusion, Sarah\'92s elevation to Holy Momma may simply have been a matter of timing, virality, and the inevitable Elvi longing for another mother figure who could consecrate a peanut butter and banana sandwich, or absolve the church choir of a flat note, sometimes in the same Sunday.
